# Pages & data loading

- **Routing:** dynamic segments in this repo are `[...slug]` (blog posts, team, store, gallery items, legal) and `[tag]` (blog tags). Path prefixes: `/blog/posts/`, `/gallery/posts/`, `/team/`, `/store/`, `/legal/`, etc. — match filenames under `src/pages/`.
- **Unified API:** `apps/web/src/lib/data.ts` centralizes list/detail data with `USE_SANITY` branching. **Many pages still call `getCollection` / `getEntry` directly** from `astro:content`; when adding Sanity-dependent features, prefer extending `data.ts` and consuming one shape to avoid drift.
- **Layouts:** `BaseLayout` wires `BaseHead` + `Navigation` + `Footer`; pass `seo` props when needed.
- **RSS:** `rss.xml.js` uses `@astrojs/rss` and a `import.meta.glob` over `./blog/*.{md,mdx}` relative to `pages/` — know this if you add file-based RSS items.

Do not claim MDX pages unless `@astrojs/mdx` appears in `apps/web` dependencies and config (it does not today).
